<main class="lp-page belkins-page" id="simple-guide">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Outbound Sales Library</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">CallTeam vs Belkins</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>CallTeam vs <span>Belkins</span>
          <small>Pricing and appointment setting</small>
        </h1>
        <p class="lp-intro">Choose CallTeam to build your prospect list, call buyers and follow up. We qualify meetings and brief your sales team. Belkins fits teams that want a wider managed program or its email and LinkedIn appointment package.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions">
          <a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare prices and scope <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="lp-text-link" href="#proof">See the 78-second demo <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lp-brief belkins-price-brief" aria-labelledby="starter-price-heading">
        <h2 id="starter-price-heading">Belkins’ starter package</h2>
        <p class="belkins-hero-price">{{ prices.starterTotal }}</p>
        <p>At the published starting rate for {{ prices.starterAppointments }} appointments, including {{ prices.setupFee }} for setup.</p>
        <a href="#starter-package">See the calculation <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <a href="#comparison">Price table</a><a href="#proof">Demo and results</a><a href="#choose">When to buy</a><a href="#compare-quotes">Compare quotes</a><a href="#questions">FAQs</a>
  </div></nav>

  <section class="lp-section belkins-first-section" id="comparison"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>CallTeam vs Belkins pricing</h2>
      <p>CallTeam sells managed calling. Prices and terms checked <time datetime="{{ guide.checkedDate }}">{{ guide.checkedLabel }}</time>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table sg-table belkins-table" role="table">
        <caption>Starting prices, outreach channels and sales handoff</caption>
        <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">What to compare</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">CallTeam managed calling</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Belkins managed retainer</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Belkins pay per appointment</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Starting price</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling"><strong>From {{ prices.callTeamMonthly }} per month</strong>. We quote list building and data if you need them.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer"><strong>{{ prices.belkinsMonthly }} per month</strong>. Belkins quotes the package you need.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment"><strong>{{ prices.appointmentRate }} per appointment</strong> plus a one-time setup fee. Minimum {{ prices.starterAppointments }} appointments.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Outreach</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling">Human cold calling, callbacks and agreed follow-up.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer">Email and LinkedIn. Calling coverage depends on the plan.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">Email and LinkedIn. Belkins handles replies and booking.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Targeting and setup</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling">We agree on buyer roles, who to exclude and how to open the call.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer">Lead research, outreach setup and campaign management as scoped.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">Targeting and messaging for the campaign. Detailed account research sits outside this package.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">What sales receives</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling">A qualified booking and notes on the buyer’s reason for meeting, timing and agreed next step in your CRM.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer">Booked meetings and reporting. Confirm which details the team will enter in your CRM.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">Bookings in your calendar and monthly reporting. Your team manages the CRM.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="sg-sources belkins-table-sources"><a href="/pricing/">CallTeam’s starting scope</a> · <a href="{{ sources.belkinsRate.url }}">Belkins’ published starting retainer</a> · <a href="{{ sources.belkinsAppointments.url }}">Belkins’ appointment package</a>. Confirm the currency on your Belkins quote.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="proof"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>See the work behind a CallTeam appointment</h2></div>
    <div class="belkins-proof-grid">
      {{ processVideoPreview('How CallTeam works', 'See how we pick accounts, qualify a buyer and hand the meeting to sales.', 'callteam-vs-belkins') }}
      <article class="belkins-case">
        <h3>11 qualified SaaS demos in 90 days</h3>
        <p>We called property and site-selection teams and asked how they pulled together market data. We booked demos with buyers who had a clear use for the platform.</p>
        <p>The campaign led to four sales opportunities and two customers within six months.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies/saas-demo-appointment-setting/">Read the campaign and qualification criteria <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="belkins-handoff">
      <h3>Sample CRM handoff</h3>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Buyer</dt><dd>Research director at a commercial property firm.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Reason to meet</dt><dd>The team pulls property and demographic data from three sources before advising clients.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Agreed next step</dt><dd>Compare two markets during the demo. The buyer will invite the analyst who prepares reports.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Open question</dt><dd>Sales still needs to confirm who signs off on software.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a href="/articles/how-to-hand-off-qualified-appointment-from-sdr-to-sales/">See the sales handoff guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="choose"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Which offer should you buy?</h2></div>
    <div class="belkins-offers">
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>CallTeam for a managed calling campaign</h3>
        <p>A call can tell us when a meeting would be useful. If a buyer wants to talk after their budget review, we agree when to call back and record what they want to discuss. <a class="belkins-inline-link" href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/">See our appointment-setting service</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-pair-card">
        <h3>Belkins for several channels under one retainer</h3>
        <p>Choose the managed program if you want research, messaging and outreach run together. Belkins lists calling tied to buying signals on Growth. Growth Plus adds cold calling and voicemail.</p>
        <p>Get a price for the calling plan you need. Belkins lists HubSpot integration as an optional add-on. It describes a six-month agreement with a three-month checkpoint. Ask what the checkpoint lets you change.</p>
        <a href="{{ sources.belkinsPlans.url }}">Check Belkins’ managed plans <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-pair-card" id="starter-package">
        <h3>Belkins if you want to buy appointments</h3>
        <p>Choose the package if email and LinkedIn can reach your buyers and your team can take over at booking. Belkins works to rebook no-shows and keeps those slots in your package.</p>
        <p class="belkins-calculation">{{ prices.starterAppointments }} × {{ prices.appointmentRate }} + {{ prices.setupFee }} = <strong>{{ prices.starterTotal }}</strong></p>
        <p>That’s <strong>{{ prices.starterUnitCost }} per appointment including setup</strong> at the starting rate. The package has a six-month delivery window from launch.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="compare-quotes"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Ask both agencies to quote the same work</h2>
      <p>Give both agencies the same buyer profile. Ask what list work they’ll handle and request a sample note for your seller.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="belkins-quote-list">
      <div><dt>Set the scope</dt><dd>List the channels you need. Give each agency the same rules for callbacks, email replies and CRM updates.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Set the meeting standard</dt><dd>Count a meeting once it takes place and sales accepts it. Agree on the buyer’s role, the problem they want to discuss and what happens when they miss the meeting.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Price the same period</dt><dd>Add setup, data, tools and recurring fees for that period. Divide the total by the meetings sales accepted. Include any contract payments due beyond the period when budgeting the purchase.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="lp-actions">
      <a class="lp-button" href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">Compare your agency quotes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="lp-text-link" href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Check your meeting criteria <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta">
      <p><strong>Want CallTeam to price your campaign?</strong> Tell us what you sell, who you want to reach and what a good meeting looks like.</p>
      <a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="callteam-vs-belkins">Book a free 30-minute call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="questions"><div class="lp-wrap lp-faq-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>CallTeam vs Belkins FAQs</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-faqs">{% for faq in guide.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary><p>{{ faq.answer }}</p></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper belkins-sources" id="sources"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Sources</h2></div>
    <ul>{% for key, source in sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p>For a wider comparison, see the <a href="/resources/b2b-lead-generation-pricing-report/">B2B lead generation pricing report</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</main>
